---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import '../../../../styles/ai.css';
---

<Layout
  title="DeepSeek API — A.I. — Rycode"
  description="OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-compatible DeepSeek endpoints. Current models: deepseek-flash and deepseek-v4-pro."
  variant="ai"
>
  <article class="ai-model">
    <p class="ai-model-kicker">DeepSeek · current</p>
    <h1 class="ai-model-title">DeepSeek API</h1>
    <p class="ai-model-dek">DeepSeek offers OpenAI-compatible and Anthropic-compatible endpoints.</p>
    <hr class="ai-model-rule" />
    <p>| | Value |
| --- | --- |
| OpenAI base URL | <code>https://api.deepseek.com</code> |
| Anthropic base URL | <code>https://api.deepseek.com/anthropic</code> |
| Current models | <code>deepseek-flash</code>, <code>deepseek-v4-pro</code> |</p>
    <p>List models with <code>GET /models</code>. Pricing and the feature matrix live on the Models &amp; Pricing page (peak/off-peak, cache hit/miss).</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Legacy aliases</h2>
    <p><code>deepseek-chat</code> and <code>deepseek-reasoner</code> were scheduled for full retirement after 24 Jul 2026 15:59 UTC (V4 Preview notes / changelog). During transition they routed to V4-Flash non-thinking / thinking. They are not current product names on the lab index.</p>
    <h2 class="ai-model-section">Sources</h2>
    <ul class="ai-model-sources">
      <li><a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/">API docs home</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/quick_start/pricing">Models &amp; Pricing</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/api/list-models/">List models</a></li>
      <li><a href="https://api-docs.deepseek.com/updates">API updates</a></li>
    </ul>
  </article>
</Layout>
